{"ID":"20240205153637-zioi71y","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153637-zioi71y","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153637-zioi71y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103237-vgeg545\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612183152-c2fm7tb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3344,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240628101803-4k7v7it\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"271葶苈（葶苈子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240822162205"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240822155802-1kfbzh7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20240822155802-1kfbzh7","updated":"20240822162205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"错录"}]},{"ID":"20240822155806-kxf0xq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240822155806-kxf0xq7","updated":"20240822160137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"播娘蒿"}]},{"ID":"20240822160809-11chkuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240822160809-11chkuk","updated":"20240822160809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产中南以及华东地区。\n【性状】\t南葶苈子：长圆形略扁，长0.81.2mm，宽约0.5mm；表面黄棕色，一端钝圆，另一端微凹或较平截，中央凹入，种脐位于凹下处，种子表面具有细密的网纹及2条纵列的浅槽。气微，味微辛，略带粘性。北葶苈子：种子扁卵形，长11.5-mm，宽0.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1mm。表面黄棕色或红棕色，微有光泽，具多数细微颗粒状突起，并可见2条纵列的浅槽，其中一条较明显，一端钝圆，另端渐尖而微凹，种脐位于凹下处，但不明显。无臭，味微苦辛，粘性较强。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，大寒。\n【功效】\t泻肺降气；祛痰平喘；利水消肿；泄逐邪。主治痰涎壅肺之喘咳痰多；肺痈；水肿；胸腹积水；小便不利；慢性肺源性心脏病；心力衰竭之喘肿；瘰疬结核。"}]},{"ID":"20240822160809-nsxqgl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240822160809-nsxqgl4","updated":"20240822160809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103238-vi21gvm.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822160809-fgnm34v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240822160809-fgnm34v","updated":"20240822160809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"葶苈子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/葶苈子-20240205164313-y3e6lww.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822160748-4qemrrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240822160748-4qemrrg","updated":"20240822160748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 486px;","style":"width: 476px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"播娘蒿"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/播娘蒿-20240822160732-3txgmhy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 476px;\" parent-style=\"width: 486px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 484px;","style":"width: 474px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"播娘蒿9"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/播娘蒿9-20240628101108-8vm096g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 474px;\" parent-style=\"width: 484px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822155806-hc17o2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240822155806-hc17o2i","updated":"20